{"ID":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","title":"10.6","type":"doc","updated":"20261006222417"},"Children":[{"ID":"20261006122018-xik824m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20261006122018-xik824m","updated":"20261006124221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你项目里线程池怎么设计的？\t\t"}]},{"ID":"20261006122018-9kfdrzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006122018-9kfdrzl","updated":"20261006122018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我的项目采用生产者消费者模型实现了一套动态线程池\n整体包含："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"工作线程池、管理线程、环形任务队列、互斥锁 + 条件变量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"工作线程作为消费者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不断从队列取任务执行\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"epoll 投递任务作为生产者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n队列用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"环形队列，高效无内存碎片"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20261006122018-9w7zeq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006122018-9w7zeq4","updated":"20261006122018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"核心机制：\n线程最小 10 个（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"核心数 ÷(1− 阻塞系数)）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n最大 200 个，任务队列容量 5 万（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"线程数 × 任务执行时间 ÷ 任务提交速度）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"每个任务只有函数指针加参数共 16 字节，0.8 MB"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）\n用 not_full、not_empty 双条件变量同步，避免空轮询\n工作线程从队列取任务执行业务逻辑，线程复用，避免频繁创建销毁"}]},{"ID":"20261006122018-gm0zlnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006122018-gm0zlnk","updated":"20261006122018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"动态扩缩容：由管理线程定期检测"}]},{"ID":"20261006122018-p1j9sip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006122018-p1j9sip","updated":"20261006122018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"管理线程"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n管理线程在创建线程池的时候就会一起被创建，和工作线程分开\n然后它会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"定期检查线程池的状态，大概每 10 秒检查一次"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n检查当前有多少存活的线程、多少忙碌的线程，以及任务队列里有多少任务"}]},{"ID":"20261006122018-1a2m3rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006122018-1a2m3rs","updated":"20261006122018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果发现任务队列里的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"任务数比空闲线程还多，或者忙碌的线程占比超过 80%"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n而且还没达到最大线程数\n它就会创建新的工作线程来处理任务\n反过来，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果忙碌的线程太少，不到存活线程的三分之一\n而且存活线程数超过了最小线程数，\n它就会让一些空闲的线程退出，节省资源"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20261006124221-mzl1zfz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20261006124221-mzl1zfz","updated":"20261006135533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目中网络模块用的API是什么"}]},{"ID":"20261006124221-5qtf8l3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006124221-5qtf8l3","updated":"20261006124221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分两端，用的是同一套 socket 语义、不同平台 API："}]},{"ID":"20261006124221-6jq003u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006124221-6jq003u","updated":"20261006124221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务端\n用的是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"epoll + 原生 POSIX socket"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n——​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"socket"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​/​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"bind"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​/​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"listen"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​/​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"accept"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​/​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"recv"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​/​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"send"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 那一套，\n配合 epoll 多路复用和线程池处理任务。"}]},{"ID":"20261006124221-tfmucsy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006124221-tfmucsy","updated":"20261006124221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"客户端\n跑在 Windows 上，用的是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Winsock"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n——就是 BSD socket 的 Windows 版，\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"WSAStartup"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 初始化后 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"socket"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​/​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"connect"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​/​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"send"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​/​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"recv"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，\n接收侧起一个 Win32 收线程循环读。"}]},{"ID":"20261006124221-ngymf7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006124221-ngymf7x","updated":"20261006124221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"值得一提的是，客户端虽然是 Qt 程序，但网络层没用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"QTcpSocket"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，\n而是手写了一个 Winsock 封装，通过中介者接口和界面解耦。"}]},{"ID":"20261006135533-hrhxiur","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20261006135533-hrhxiur","updated":"20261006163000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nginx服务器是怎么部署的？内部怎么处理音视频流的？"}]},{"ID":"20261006135533-psi3bo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006135533-psi3bo7","updated":"20261006135533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nginx 是编译了 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nginx-rtmp-module"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的版本，\n一份配置同时开了两块：\nRTMP 的 1935 端口做直播和点播，\nHTTP 的 8080 端口做静态文件点播，\n用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"alias"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 把 URL 映射到后端写视频的磁盘目录，\n配好 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Range"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 支持断点续传，再 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nginx -t"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 校验、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"systemctl"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 启起来就行。"}]},{"ID":"20261006135533-kj6l3ra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006135533-kj6l3ra","updated":"20261006135533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Nginx 不解码也不转码，只负责搬字节和做协议转换"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20261006135533-c90lpg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006135533-c90lpg5","updated":"20261006135533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体来说：\nRTMP 直播走的是发布/订阅模型，推流端 publish 上来，\nnginx 按时间戳缓冲后多路转发给所有拉流端；\nRTMP 点播是 nginx 读磁盘上的 FLV 文件，按 tag 时间戳顺序回放给客户端；\nHTTP 点播就是静态文件服务，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"code text","TextMarkTextContent":"sendfile"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 零拷贝发文件、客户端自己 Range 拖动"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20261006163000-1npa5zg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20261006163000-1npa5zg","updated":"20261006172633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"环形队列的原理"}]},{"ID":"20261006163000-aww6jq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006163000-aww6jq8","updated":"20261006163000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原理"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n它底层是一块"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"连续定长数组"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，配两个指针——写指针和读指针。\n入队往写指针位置放数据、出队从读指针位置取数据，\n两个指针每次都 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(位置+1) % 容量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 取模回绕，\n走到数组末尾就绕回开头，首尾相接成\"环\"。\n槽位循环复用，\n全程不搬动已有元素，靠计数或指针判满判空。"}]},{"ID":"20261006163000-css1cra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006163000-css1cra","updated":"20261006163000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"和普通队列的区别"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n普通队列（尤其链表实现）每个节点都要 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"malloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​/​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"free"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，\n高频下产生内存碎片、分配开销大、cache 还不友好；\n环形队列"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"预分配一次、之后零分配、无碎片、O(1) 且连续内存 cache 友好"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n另外普通队列容量能动态涨，环形队列容量固定\n——这反而成了优点：\n它是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"有界队列"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，满了阻塞生产者，天然提供背压；\n而且\""},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"指针移动即提交"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"这个语义，\n能进一步做成单生产者单消费者无锁环形队列（原子指针+内存屏障），普通链表很难做到。"}]},{"ID":"20261006172633-s42va0u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006172633-s42va0u","updated":"20261006173100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Linux中的top命令是什么意思"}]},{"ID":"20261006172633-vthl8x9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006172633-vthl8x9","updated":"20261006172633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"top"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是 Linux 下最常用的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"实时系统监控工具"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n用来动态查看系统的整体运行状态和进程资源占用情况。\n常用的交互操作有：\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"P"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 按 CPU 排序、\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"M"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 按内存排序、\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"k"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 杀进程、\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 展开每个 CPU 核心、\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"q"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 退出。\n实际排查问题时，我一般先用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"top"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 看整体负载和哪个进程占资源高，\n再配合 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ps"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"pidstat"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"iostat"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 进一步定位。"}]},{"ID":"20261006173100-36ul6sf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006173100-36ul6sf","updated":"20261006173535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Valgrind 的底层实现"}]},{"ID":"20261006173100-k39n0z4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006173100-k39n0z4","updated":"20261006173100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"valgrind --leak-check=full ./your_program"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，\n能直接报出哪一行 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"malloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 没配对 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"free"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，最经典但性能开销大"}]},{"ID":"20261006173100-9wbjuwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006173100-9wbjuwh","updated":"20261006173100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Valgrind = 模拟 CPU 执行 + 影子内存状态跟踪 + 内存分配释放监控"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20261006173100-zkwf3iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006173100-zkwf3iy","updated":"20261006173100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Valgrind 底层核心是\n通过模拟 CPU 执行来实现内存检测的\n它会为\n程序的每一块内存维护一套影子内存（shadow memory）\n用来标记这块内存的状态：是否可访问、是否已初始化、归属哪个 malloc"}]},{"ID":"20261006173100-wkr2f76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006173100-wkr2f76","updated":"20261006173100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在程序运行时，Valgrind 会逐"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"条指令拦截并检查所有内存操作"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n一旦出现越界访问、使用野指针、读取未初始化内存等非法行为，\n就立刻报错\n同时它会全程跟踪 malloc/free/new/delete，\n记录每块堆内存的生命周期"}]},{"ID":"20261006173100-5uxu9ti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006173100-5uxu9ti","updated":"20261006173100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"程序退出前，Valgrind 会扫描所有堆内存\n把已经分配但没有释放、也没有指针指向的内存标记为内存泄漏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，最终汇总输出泄漏报告"}]},{"ID":"20261006173100-g6vasrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006173100-g6vasrb","updated":"20261006173100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它不是假跑，程序是真跑了\n但也不是直接跑在原始指令上，\n而是先被 Valgrind 接管、翻译、插桩后再执行"}]},{"ID":"20261006173535-j5sce8h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006173535-j5sce8h","updated":"20261006174349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用子Agent有什么优缺点"}]},{"ID":"20261006173535-jshoqoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006173535-jshoqoq","updated":"20261006173535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好处\n是能拆分复杂任务、并行处理、隔离上下文，\n适合多步骤或需要不同专长的场景。\n缺点\n是会增加调度和通信开销，\n链路更长、调试更难，还要处理子Agent失败或结果不一致的问题。\n所以我的原则是：\n任务能简单直接完成就不拆，\n只有在复杂度、并行度或上下文隔离收益明显时才用。"}]},{"ID":"20261006173535-gu6nfzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006173535-gu6nfzs","updated":"20261006173535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另外"}]},{"ID":"20261006173535-fygimdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006173535-fygimdl","updated":"20261006173535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"子Agent之间不是孤立的，依赖关系由主Agent编排；\n能并行的并行，必须串行的串行，部分依赖的走流水线。"}]},{"ID":"20261006174349-sscrs2r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006174349-sscrs2r","updated":"20261006174349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DNS劫持一般发生在什么阶段"}]},{"ID":"20261006174349-c8iqh78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006174349-c8iqh78","updated":"20261006174349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DNS劫持，简单说就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"在域名解析阶段"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，\n把域名对应的正确IP偷偷换成假IP，把你引到攻击者的服务器上"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n常见发生在\n本地hosts或缓存被篡改、\n路由器或本地DNS被改、\n查询过程被中间人抢答、\n以及递归服务器被缓存投毒这些环节。"}]},{"ID":"20261006174349-p8svyn1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006174349-p8svyn1","updated":"20261006174349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DOH（DNS over HTTPS）"}]},{"ID":"20261006174349-gbsgyxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006174349-gbsgyxm","updated":"20261006174349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DoH就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"把DNS查询用HTTPS加密传输"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n而不是像传统DNS那样走明文UDP。\n好处是防窃听、防篡改、防中间人劫持，\n因为查询内容藏在HTTPS里，中间人看不到也改不了。\n代价是可能绕过企业内网的DNS管控，也会让网络管理员更难排查问题。\n一句话：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"DoH就是把域名解析这段明文通信，\n升级成加密的HTTPS，\n主要解决隐私和劫持问题。"}]},{"ID":"20261006174349-s05fw46","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006174349-s05fw46","updated":"20261006174632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么防范 DNS 劫持"}]},{"ID":"20261006174349-fnl63b8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006174349-fnl63b8","updated":"20261006174349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"防范 DNS 劫持主要从终端、网络、服务端、协议加固四方面入手："}]},{"ID":"20261006174349-ebm7fyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006174349-ebm7fyq","updated":"20261006174349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手机电脑别用运营商自动 DNS，换成阿里、腾讯这种靠谱公共 DNS\n开加密 DNS，不让解析数据裸奔被人篡改\n改路由器默认密码，别让别人偷偷改你路由器 DNS\n不乱下软件、不乱点链接，防止恶意程序篡改本地 Hosts\n正规网站开启 DNSSEC，给 DNS 解析加一层真伪校验"}]},{"ID":"20261006174632-autd0rc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006174632-autd0rc","updated":"20261006181450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多线程的场景去使用这个weak"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ptr，我需要去加锁吗？"}]},{"ID":"20261006174632-5sc99hm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006174632-5sc99hm","updated":"20261006174632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不需要。\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"weak_ptr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lock()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 本身是线程安全的，\n多个线程各自用自己的 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"weak_ptr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 去 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lock"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，\n不用加锁。"}]},{"ID":"20261006174632-8b8z75c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006174632-8b8z75c","updated":"20261006174632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但两种情况下要加：\n一是多个线程并发读写"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"同一个"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"weak_ptr"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 对象本身，\n得用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"atomic\u0026lt;weak_ptr\u0026gt;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 或加锁；\n二是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lock()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 只保证拿到对象时它还活着，\n不保证对象内部数据的线程安全，\n访问对象成员该加还得加。"}]},{"ID":"20261006181450-dk7ipts","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006181450-dk7ipts","updated":"20261006182046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在C++中如何判断两个double类型的数据相等？"}]},{"ID":"20261006181450-6t95spj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006181450-6t95spj","updated":"20261006181450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不能直接用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"=="},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，\n因为浮点数有精度误差。\n正确做法是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"判断两者差值是否小于一个容差"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n比如 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"fabs(a - b) \u0026lt; epsilon"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]},{"ID":"20261006181450-t9k7ill","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006181450-t9k7ill","updated":"20261006181450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但更稳妥的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"相对误差"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"fabs(a - b) \u0026lt;= epsilon * max(1.0, fabs(a), fabs(b))"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n这样对大数小数都适用。"}]},{"ID":"20261006181450-dlfgvck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006181450-dlfgvck","updated":"20261006181450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果\n对精度要求高，\n可以用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std::nextafter"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 判断两者是否在可表示的相邻范围内，\n或者直接比较 ULP 距离。"}]},{"ID":"20261006182046-4zow1ui","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006182046-4zow1ui","updated":"20261006182504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"涉及金钱类带小数点的数字，应该怎么存储这类数据？"}]},{"ID":"20261006182046-q09d3b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006182046-q09d3b1","updated":"20261006182046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用整数存最小单位"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n精度到分就按分存 long long，\n三位小数就乘 1000，\n四位就乘 10000，\n全程整数运算，展示时再格式化回去。\n除法\n要特别注意，必须明确舍入规则，比如四舍五入或银行家舍入，\n余数不能随便丢。\n如果不想手动管理缩放，也可以用 BigDecimal 或 decimal 这类定点/高精度库。"}]},{"ID":"20261006182504-nbw3ett","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006182504-nbw3ett","updated":"20261006183627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哈希函数算出来哈希值，怎么把它映射到哈希表的数组下标？"}]},{"ID":"20261006182504-igk3vrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006182504-igk3vrs","updated":"20261006182504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通常用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"取模"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\nindex = hash % table_size"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。\n但实际实现里更常用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"位运算"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n当表长是 2 的幂时，用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"hash \u0026amp; (table_size - 1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 代替取模，\n效果一样但快得多。\n还要注意两点：哈希值可能为负，要先转无符号避免越界；\n高位信息容易浪费，所以像 Java 会先做扰动 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"hash ^ (hash \u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; 16)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，\n让分布更均匀。"}]},{"ID":"20261006183627-781fzyn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006183627-781fzyn","updated":"20261006183924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说一下几种const的用法"}]},{"ID":"20261006183627-vb8c9zr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006183627-vb8c9zr","updated":"20261006183627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"修饰变量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n值不可改。const int a = 1;"}]},{"ID":"20261006183627-mfgqhd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006183627-mfgqhd9","updated":"20261006183627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"修饰指针"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n分三种——const int* p 指向的值不可改；\nint* const p 指针本身不可改；\nconst int* const p 两者都不可改。"}]},{"ID":"20261006183627-knfvsm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006183627-knfvsm6","updated":"20261006183627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"修饰函数参数"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n表示函数内不修改这个参数，\n常配合引用避免拷贝，比如 const string\u0026 s。"}]},{"ID":"20261006183627-sgsaa1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006183627-sgsaa1u","updated":"20261006183627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"修饰成员函数"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n写在函数后面，如 int get() const;，\n表示不修改对象成员，const 对象只能调这类函数。"}]},{"ID":"20261006183627-2s9hkwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006183627-2s9hkwo","updated":"20261006183627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"修饰返回值"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n防止返回值被修改，比如返回 const T\u0026。"}]},{"ID":"20261006183627-uyimei7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006183627-uyimei7","updated":"20261006183627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"修饰成员变量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n必须在初始化列表初始化，之后不可改。"}]},{"ID":"20261006183924-ko3nb7p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006183924-ko3nb7p","updated":"20261006184357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"const函数是怎么实现的"}]},{"ID":"20261006183924-ny74rz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006183924-ny74rz6","updated":"20261006183924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"const 函数就是把 this 变成 const 指针，\n所以不能改成员、不能调非 const 函数，\nmutable 成员除外。"}]},{"ID":"20261006184357-6m1ix3w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006184357-6m1ix3w","updated":"20261006190452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚基类表的构成\t\u003e\u003e"}]},{"ID":"20261006184357-wsmac7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006184357-wsmac7o","updated":"20261006184357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚基类表是 C++ 为支持虚继承而生成的一张偏移量表，它与虚函数表相互独立，主要用于定位共享的虚基类子对象"}]},{"ID":"20261006184357-85ip2po","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006184357-85ip2po","updated":"20261006184357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个使用了虚继承的对象，会在头部包含一个虚基类表指针 vbptr，指向属于该类的虚基类表"}]},{"ID":"20261006184357-c94re6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006184357-c94re6t","updated":"20261006184357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表中存储的核心内容是各类偏移值，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"包括当前对象起始地址到虚基类表指针的偏移，以及从当前对象到各个虚基类子对象的偏移量"}]},{"ID":"20261006184357-f9gxm9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006184357-f9gxm9u","updated":"20261006184357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在菱形继承结构中，如果不使用虚继承，最底层的子类会间接包含两份顶层基类的子对象\n引入虚继承后，顶层基类变为虚基类，在最终对象中只会存在一份共享的虚基类子对象\n此时各个派生类通过自身的虚基类表，利用表中记录的偏移量，都能准确找到这份唯一的虚基类\n依靠虚基类表提供的寻址信息，程序可以唯一、正确地访问基类成员，从而从根本上解决了菱形继承带来的二义性和数据冗余问题"}]},{"ID":"20261006184357-2budjr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006184357-2budjr5","updated":"20261006184357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唯一的那份父类数据，存在最终派生类对象内存的末尾，中间子类不再存放，只通过偏移去查找"}]},{"ID":"20261006184357-znzhq25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006184357-znzhq25","updated":"20261006184357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚基类表中主要存放两类偏移量：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一类是虚基类指针 vbptr 到当前所属子类对象起始地址的偏移\n另一类是从当前对象位置到共享虚基类子对象的偏移，通过这些偏移量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n编译器就能在菱形继承等复杂结构里，精准定位唯一的虚基类，避免数据重复和访问二义性"}]},{"ID":"20261006184357-j8rsfow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006184357-j8rsfow","updated":"20261006184357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我在哪儿：这个虚基类指针，距离当前对象最开头有多远\n虚基类在哪儿：从当前位置出发，往内存里走多少字节，能找到那个唯一共享的虚基类\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"自身偏移"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"：修正当前子对象相对于对象首地址的位置；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚基类偏移"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"：记录从当前位置到尾部共享虚基类的距离；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n依靠两个偏移量，间接访问唯一一份虚基类，解决菱形继承数据冗余。"}]},{"ID":"20261006184357-5yxxaxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006184357-5yxxaxv","updated":"20261006184357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假设只留 1 个偏移，会发生什么？\n你只能存一种距离：\n要么只存「我到开头的距离」→ 找不到末尾的虚基类\n要么只存「我到虚基类的距离」→ 指针向上转型时，无法修正自身地址，崩溃"}]},{"ID":"20261006184357-lq652s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006184357-lq652s6","updated":"20261006184357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先看表：vbptr 在我这个子对象偏移多少？\n→ 找到虚基类指针\n再看表：从我的子对象开头走多少到 A？\n→ 直接跳到唯一的虚基类"}]},{"ID":"20261006190452-g9txfbr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006190452-g9txfbr","updated":"20261006191601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"unodered"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"map迭代器失效"}]},{"ID":"20261006190452-rrgfzta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006190452-rrgfzta","updated":"20261006190452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"unordered_map"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的迭代器失效分插入和删除两种情况。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"插入"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n时，如果触发 rehash，桶数组扩容、元素重新分布，所有迭代器全部失效；\n没触发 rehash 的话，只有被插入桶的迭代器可能失效，\n其他桶一般还有效，但标准不保证，稳妥起见都当失效处理。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"删除"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n时，只有指向被删元素的迭代器失效，其他迭代器不受影响。"}]},{"ID":"20261006191601-zahjhyj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006191601-zahjhyj","updated":"20261006222321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"vector 扩容后，之前的元素引用还能用吗？悬空了怎么办？"}]},{"ID":"20261006191601-khsuecd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006191601-khsuecd","updated":"20261006191601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"vector"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 扩容会重新分配内存、搬元素、释放旧内存，\n所以之前存的引用、指针、迭代器全部失效，\n再用就是悬空引用，属于未定义行为。\n解决办法：\n要么每次现场取 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"v[0]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，要么提前 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"reserve"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 保证容量，\n要么换 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"deque"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"list"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 这类地址稳定的容器。"}]},{"ID":"20261006222321-ds5f55d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20261006222321-ds5f55d","updated":"20261006222417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目RAG部分的架构"}]},{"ID":"20261006222321-kba4j8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006222321-kba4j8u","updated":"20261006222321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体是\""},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"离线索引 + 在线检索"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"两条解耦的链路，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中间用一个向量库做检索投影，MySQL 是唯一事实源。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20261006222321-c9hbsgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006222321-c9hbsgz","updated":"20261006222321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"离线侧有两个数据源。\n聊天记录\n走"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"后台增量索引"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n后台线程每 60 秒按主键 id 水位从 t_message 拉一批\n（游标持久化在 MySQL，失败不前移保证不丢数据），做脏数据和连点去重，切片\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用本地 bge-small 模型向量化"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n按会话参与者各复制一份写入 Chroma，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"metadata 带 user_id 实现可见性隔离"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n上传文档\n走 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"HTTP 接口"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n先校验建档立刻返回 doc_id，BackgroundTasks 里解析 txt/md/pdf，\n按页和标题切片后同样向量化入库，块 id 是 doc:{doc_id}:{块号}。\n删改时先删向量再改数据库，\n避免出现\"库里有、检索不到\"的残留。"}]},{"ID":"20261006222321-bgn16ee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006222321-bgn16ee","updated":"20261006222321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在线侧\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"是 /ai/chat："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n服务端从登录态"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"取 user_id 和问题转发过来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n问题向量化后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在 Chroma 里带 where={user_id} 下推过滤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n——隔离是靠向量库的 metadata 硬条件，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"别人的语料在库里就被挡掉了，不是查出来再筛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n召回后做时间范围过滤、相关性下限、人名命中加权、AI 对话降权，\n最后拼进 prompt 并附引用，另外还叠了最近 10 轮的短期对话记忆。"}]},{"ID":"20261006222417-fr6bpe0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20261006222417-fr6bpe0","updated":"20261006222417"}}]}